 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives a random message function from ",
 StyleBox["a", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 ", an association, drawn uniformly.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"f3ab5ea9-4c33-47e3-9790-5e44fbb8be4d"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["RandomInfraMessageFunction"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/RandomInfraMessageFunction", 
